{
  "_comment": [
    "TICKET-201 — optional cursor PNG overrides (desktop).",
    "Override-only: drop a PNG named below into this folder to replace that",
    "cursor; if the file is absent or fails to load, the game falls back to its",
    "built-in procedural cursor art. No PNGs ship by default.",
    "'hotspot' is [x, y] in PIXELS from the PNG's top-left — the point that",
    "tracks the mouse (arrow tip, crosshair centre, flag-pole top). Match it to",
    "your PNG's size. The PNG is drawn at its native pixel size.",
    "Set env CURSOR_PNG=0 to force the procedural cursor regardless of overrides."
  ],
